&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:15.8pt;min-height:15.8pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-color:#a9a9a9;border-bottom-color:#a9a9a9;border-left-color:#a9a9a9;border-right-color:#a9a9a9;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:11pt;"&gt;(4)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-color:#a9a9a9;border-bottom-color:#a9a9a9;border-left-color:#a9a9a9;border-right-color:#a9a9a9;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:11pt;"&gt;臨時報告書&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td colspan="2" style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-color:#a9a9a9;border-bottom-color:#a9a9a9;border-left-color:#a9a9a9;border-right-color:#a9a9a9;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-color:#a9a9a9;border-bottom-color:#a9a9a9;border-left-color:#a9a9a9;border-right-color:#a9a9a9;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:11pt;font-size:11pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-color:#a9a9a9;border-bottom-color:#a9a9a9;border-left-color:#a9a9a9;border-right-color:#a9a9a9;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:26.3pt;min-height:26.3pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-color:#a9a9a9;border-bottom-color:#a9a9a9;border-left-color:#a9a9a9;border-right-color:#a9a9a9;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:11pt;font-size:11pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td colspan="5" style="vertical-align:top;border-top-color:#A9A9A9;border-bottom-color:#A9A9A9;border-left-color:#A9A9A9;border-right-color:#A9A9A9;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:11pt;"&gt;企業内容の開示に関する内閣府令第19条第２項第９号の２（株主総会における議決権行使の結果）の規定に基づく臨時報告書&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:11pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;　2023年６月19日近畿財務局長に提出。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p style="clear:both; line-height:0.75pt; width:100%; font-size:0.75pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:OtherReferenceInformationTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:InformationAboutCompanyWhichProvidesGuaranteeToReportingCompanyTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">
